<!DOCTYPE html>
<html xmlns:o='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office' xmlns:w='urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word' xmlns='http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40'>
<head>
<meta charset='utf-8'>
<title>CA Foundation Online Test Questions</title>
<style>
  body { font-family: 'Calibri', 'Arial', sans-serif; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; color: #1a1a1a; margin: 30px; }
  h1 { font-size: 18pt; color: #1e40af; border-bottom: 2px solid #1e40af; padding-bottom: 6px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  .q-box { background: #f8fafc; border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 18px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #e2e8f0; }
  .q-title { font-weight: bold; font-size: 13pt; color: #0f172a; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .subject { font-size: 10pt; color: #475569; font-weight: bold; text-transform: uppercase; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  .options { margin-left: 15px; margin-top: 6px; }
  .option { margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 11pt; }
  .ans { font-weight: bold; color: #166534; margin-top: 10px; font-size: 11pt; background: #dcfce7; display: inline-block; padding: 4px 10px; border-radius: 4px; border: 1px solid #bbf7d0; }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<h1>CA Foundation Online Test - Questions & Options</h1>
<p style='color: #475569; font-size: 11pt;'><strong>Course:</strong> CA Foundation | <strong>Total Questions:</strong> 5 MCQs | <strong>Time:</strong> 1 Min Per Question</p>
<hr style='border: none; border-top: 1px solid #cbd5e1; margin-bottom: 20px;'>

<div class='q-box'>
  <div class='subject'>Question 1 - Partnership & Financial Accounting</div>
  <div class='q-title'>Q1. A partnership firm runs a beauty parlor and a partner avails makeup services for ₹ 2,000 involving cosmetics costing ₹ 200. What should be credited?</div>
  <div class='options'>
    <div class='option'>A. Sales ₹ 200</div>
    <div class='option'>B. Purchase ₹ 800</div>
    <div class='option'>C. Sales ₹ 800</div>
    <div class='option'>D. Purchase ₹ 200</div>
  </div>
  <div class='ans'>Correct Answer: Option D (Purchase ₹ 200)</div>
</div>

<div class='q-box'>
  <div class='subject'>Question 2 - Asset Classification & Accounting</div>
  <div class='q-title'>Q2. A small painting of a renowned artist is purchased for an office premises costing ₹ 7 Lakh. How should this expenditure be classified?</div>
  <div class='options'>
    <div class='option'>A. Revenue Expense</div>
    <div class='option'>B. Tangible Asset</div>
    <div class='option'>C. Intangible Asset</div>
    <div class='option'>D. Deferred Revenue Expense</div>
  </div>
  <div class='ans'>Correct Answer: Option C (Intangible Asset)</div>
</div>

<div class='q-box'>
  <div class='subject'>Question 3 - Inventory & Fixed Asset / PPE Accounting</div>
  <div class='q-title'>Q3. Crockery used in a restaurant is classified under:</div>
  <div class='options'>
    <div class='option'>A. Spare Parts</div>
    <div class='option'>B. Loose Tools</div>
    <div class='option'>C. Inventory</div>
    <div class='option'>D. Fixed Asset / PPEs</div>
  </div>
  <div class='ans'>Correct Answer: Option D (Fixed Asset / PPEs)</div>
</div>

<div class='q-box'>
  <div class='subject'>Question 4 - Expenditure Classification</div>
  <div class='q-title'>Q4. ₹ 100 Crore paid to Ranveer Singh for acting in movie 'Dhurandhar' is classified as:</div>
  <div class='options'>
    <div class='option'>A. Revenue Expense</div>
    <div class='option'>B. Deferred Revenue Expense</div>
    <div class='option'>C. Intangible Asset</div>
    <div class='option'>D. Deferred Capital Expenditure</div>
  </div>
  <div class='ans'>Correct Answer: Option C (Intangible Asset)</div>
</div>

<div class='q-box'>
  <div class='subject'>Question 5 - Capital & Revenue Expenditure</div>
  <div class='q-title'>Q5. Glow Signboard bought for a showroom is classified as:</div>
  <div class='options'>
    <div class='option'>A. Marketing Expenditure</div>
    <div class='option'>B. Deferred Revenue Expenditure</div>
    <div class='option'>C. Revenue Expenditure</div>
    <div class='option'>D. Fixed Asset / PPE</div>
  </div>
  <div class='ans'>Correct Answer: Option D (Fixed Asset / PPE)</div>
</div>

</body>
</html>